// Orphaned handlers found by a handle_code_* vs. handled_codes.def sweep
// (seven-fuzzer, 2026-08-24). Only entries individually confirmed against
// iced_x86's real Code enum (iced_x86/include/iced_x86/code.hpp) are
// registered here -- the sweep's naive function-name diff produced a much
// longer candidate list (ENTERD/Q/W, FIST_M64INT, LDMXCSR, STMXCSR,
// PUSH_IMM8/32, the VEX YMM-width shift family, and the whole EVEX
// K1Z-masked shuffle/unpack/pack family), but most of those handler
// functions turn out to be misnamed relative to the actual enum value they
// were meant to implement (e.g. missing an _IMM8/_B32 suffix, or a different
// operand count than the name implies), which only surfaces as a hard
// compile error if guessed at blindly. Left unregistered pending per-name
// verification -- not attempted here to avoid shipping more guesses.
KUBERA_CODE(Shufps_xmm_xmmm128_imm8, SHUFPS_XMM_XMMM128_IMM8)
KUBERA_CODE(VEX_Andn_r64_r64_rm64, VEX_ANDN_R64_R64_RM64)
KUBERA_CODE(Prefetcht2_m8, PREFETCHT2_M8)
